White Sands Testing Ground
  White Sands is the testing
grounds for the latest aircraft
prototypes.  There are no enemies
in this theater, but there are some
practice targets.
  There is an experimental aircraft
here, but it cannot be flown until
the pilot is given clearance.





------------------------------------------------------------------------
------------- Welcome to the White Sands testing grounds ---------------
------------------------------------------------------------------------

  The experimental aircraft waiting at the strip is scheduled for a
high altitude run.  The test pilot is to hit the large button marked
<enter> when he or she attains the maximum possible altitude.  It is
recommended that the plane be above 60,000 feet before engaging the
apparatus.

  This aircraft is to be flown by Captains with explicit orders.

  There are 6 fake generator orbs set up to the north of here.  Recently
there has been an accident when a pilot lost control of a test aircraft.
The wreckage lies just off the end of the strip.





